OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThrough the
OL,6,Fevening and overnight it will remain
OL,7,Fcloudy across all parts with a few
OL,8,Flight outbreaks of rain and drizzle
OL,9,Fpossible, but predominantly dry.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FThe east will be mostly cloudy
OL,12,Fwith some outbreaks of light rain and
OL,13,Fdrizzle possible. Further west will be
OL,14,Fdry with bright and sunny intervals
OL,15,Fdeveloping later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
